# Production build (npm run build) shu faylni o'qiydi.
# Backend Render'ga deploy bo'lgach, quyidagi manzilni HAQIQIY Render URL bilan
# almashtiring (masalan, https://agrozot-backend.onrender.com — oxirida / bo'lmasin),
# so'ng qayta build qilib deploy qiling.
# Netlify'ning o'zida build qilinsa, Dashboard'dagi VITE_API_URL bu fayldan ustun turadi.
VITE_API_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com
